# One user per service. Mosquitto ACLs only grant, so each rule lists what the user may do.

user z2m
topic readwrite zigbee2mqtt/#

user hub
topic readwrite zigbee2mqtt/#
topic read  mc/v1/req/hub/#
topic read  mc/v1/event/api/#
topic read  mc/v1/status/api/#
topic write mc/v1/res/#
topic write mc/v1/event/#
topic write mc/v1/state/#
topic write mc/v1/status/hub

user api
topic write mc/v1/req/hub/#
topic write mc/v1/event/api/#
topic write mc/v1/status/api/#
topic read  mc/v1/res/#
topic read  mc/v1/event/#
topic read  mc/v1/state/#
topic read  mc/v1/status/#
